error[E0173]: the value of a `let ... else` cannot end in `}`
 --> E0173.sisu:4:19
  |
4 |     let Some(v) = match k { _ => o } else { return }
  |                   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ this ends in `}`
  |
help: put the value in `( )`
  |
4 |     let Some(v) = (match k { _ => o }) else { return }
  |                   +                  +

sisu: 1 error
sisu: for more on a code, run `sisu explain <code>`: E0173
